   $q$Who most likely left the plate of sweet bread, and why?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The speaker's brother, to thank the speaker for borrowing gloves","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-character"},{"text":"Mrs. Abara, to thank the speaker for shoveling her walk","is_correct":true},{"text":"A neighbor down the street, who wanted to share extra bread","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"The speaker's family, as a reward for waking up so early","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Mrs. Abara, to thank the speaker for shoveling her walk$q$, $q$Mrs. Abara is the person the speaker helped, and the note says "Thank you for being there" in "shaky and small" writing, which fits someone older who uses a cane. Nothing suggests the brother knew about the shoveling.$q$, 'draft', '3263ec3c-dacb-579a-98d8-687d2026ecd9')
