   $q$Which detail from the story shows that Sofia had trouble finding her way?$q$, $q$[{"text":"\"Sofia kept the napkin in her pocket all week.\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-event"},{"text":"\"She was sitting alone at the end of a long table.\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"weak-evidence"},{"text":"\"She walked into the art room instead of the library.\"","is_correct":true},{"text":"\"The principal brought a new girl into Sofia's classroom.\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$"She walked into the art room instead of the library."$q$, $q$Going into the art room when she wanted the library shows she was lost. Sitting alone shows she felt left out, not that she could not find her way.$q$, 'draft', '7ff0085c-5c25-586e-8494-52f300151b0f')
